<%# crosswire:contract v1 %>
<%#
  Deliberately dumb — every class decision lives in Crosswire::UI::Badge, so this
  file is safe to restyle, shadow, or eject. See docs/DECISIONS.md D6.

  Locals:
    badge    Crosswire::UI::Badge
    label    String or nil — plain-text badge content
    content  String or nil — already-captured block content; takes precedence over
             `label` when both are given
%>
<span <%= cw_attrs(badge.attrs) %>><%= content ? content : label %></span>
